@startuml
[*] --> TimeDisplay
TimeDisplay --> AdjustTime : adjust button pressed
AdjustTime --> AdjustHour : adjust button pressed
AdjustTime --> AdjustMinute : adjust button pressed
AdjustTime --> AdjustAlarmHour : adjust button pressed
AdjustTime --> AdjustAlarmMinute : adjust button pressed
AdjustHour --> TimeDisplay : increase button pressed
AdjustMinute --> TimeDisplay : increase button pressed
AdjustAlarmHour --> TimeDisplay : increase button pressed
AdjustAlarmMinute --> TimeDisplay : increase button pressed
TimeDisplay --> AlarmState : alarm on/off button pressed
AlarmState --> TimeDisplay : alarm on/off button pressed
TimeDisplay --> LightOn : light button pressed
LightOn --> LightOff : light button released
LightOff --> TimeDisplay : light button pressed

state AlarmState {
    [*] --> AlarmRinging
}

AlarmRinging --> [*] : alarm stop button pressed

@enduml
